</style></head><body><main>
<h1>☀ 해 경로 · 노을 시뮬레이터</h1>
<section class="card">
<div class="row"><label>위도<input id="lat" type="number" step="any" value="37.5698"></label><label>경도<input id="lon" type="number" step="any" value="126.8232"></label><label>UTC+<input id="tz" type="number" step="0.5"></label></div>
